00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:03.610
Chisato, how d'ya feel 'bout our captain?

00:24:03.610 --> 00:24:05.320
What do you mean, exactly?

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:08.250
We ain't got anyone who can
pitch, but he ain't fixin' it.

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:10.210
Does he even care 'bout winnin'?

00:24:10.210 --> 00:24:12.210
Why the heck is he our captain?

00:24:12.210 --> 00:24:16.890
I'm sure there must be some
reason why they made him captain.

00:24:17.410 --> 00:24:19.650
Seriously, I don't get it!

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:22.090
Next time: "What's With This Guy?!"

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>What's With This Guy?!</b>

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:24.640
Run to the stage of your dreams!
